WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.000
Leads: everyone looking for something: what they want, budget, score, agent and follow-up status.

2
00:00:09.546 --> 00:00:14.370
Sort leads by score; "Why this score" shows where it comes from.

3
00:00:14.922 --> 00:00:18.470
Hand a lead to an agent with "Assign an agent".

4
00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:24.500
Send suitable listings with "Send to a person" and update the follow-up status.

5
00:00:25.047 --> 00:00:30.760
When a lead is lost, write the reason; later it shows why deals don't close.
